      "title": "Latvia joins the Artemis Accords",
      "link": "https://spacenews.com/latvia-joins-the-artemis-accords/",
      "description": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?fit=1024%2C640&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"Artemis Accords Latvia\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?w=2048&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=1024%2C640&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=768%2C480&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=1536%2C960&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=1200%2C750&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=2000%2C1250&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=780%2C488&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=400%2C250&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?resize=706%2C441&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55219327626_68642e0275_k.jpg?fit=1024%2C640&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>\n<p>Latvia is the latest country to sign the Artemis Accords as part of a new push to use the Accords to foster cooperation on NASA’s lunar exploration ambitions.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://spacenews.com/latvia-joins-the-artemis-accords/\">Latvia joins the Artemis Accords</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://spacenews.com\">SpaceNews</a>.</p>\n",
