    {
      "title": "In the wake of Artemis 2, America needs to consider the ‘why’ of its government space program",
      "link": "https://spacenews.com/in-the-wake-of-artemis-2-america-needs-to-consider-the-why-of-its-government-space-program/",
      "description": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?fit=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"Orion moon\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?w=2048&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=1536%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=1200%2C900&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=2000%2C1500&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=780%2C585&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?resize=706%2C530&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/spacenews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/55193946135_07de583c29_k.jpg?fit=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>\n<p>The moon itself does not wax and wane as frequently as American public opinion on its space program. The Artemis 2 astronauts barely gulped their first taste of fresh Pacific air before a chorus of voices began criticizing the Artemis program as a waste of money for which the American people received little in return. [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://spacenews.com/in-the-wake-of-artemis-2-america-needs-to-consider-the-why-of-its-government-space-program/\">In the wake of Artemis 2, America needs to consider the ‘why’ of its government space program</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://spacenews.com\">SpaceNews</a>.</p>\n",
      "pub_date": "Mon, 20 Apr 2026 13:00:00 +0000",
      "source": "Space News",
      "data_coleta": "2026-04-21",
      "tentativas": 0
    },
